00:00:01.960 --> 00:00:03.000
Entonces realmente piensas

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:04.040
your grandma will

00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:04.920
come out of the coma

00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:05.920
if she sees her daughter?

00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:06.880
I mean, your mom.

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:08.520
Well, I’ve read about

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:10.040
some cases like this.

00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:11.640
People in comas,

00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:12.760
they can feel everything.

00:00:12.760 --> 00:00:13.240
Really?

00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:14.120
Yeah.

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:17.000
What that guy doing here?

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:18.200
Who is he?

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:18.920
Oh, god.

00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:19.760
Let's go.

00:00:19.840 --> 00:00:20.880
Miss Rose, wait.

00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:22.000
Mister Henderson would

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:23.200
like to speak with you.

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:24.840
He has my phone number.

00:00:24.840 --> 00:00:26.440
He can call.

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:29.120
Why bother when we

00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:30.840
can talk face to face?

00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:32.720
Do you have any updates

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:34.040
about my mother?

00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:35.000
Don't worry.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.720
My best people are on it.

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:38.200
We'll get the results.

00:00:38.440 --> 00:00:39.080
Fine.

00:00:39.080 --> 00:00:40.280
When you have the results,

00:00:40.280 --> 00:00:41.000
text me.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:41.960
Bye.

00:00:42.760 --> 00:00:44.360
Gina, I looked at your schedule

00:00:44.360 --> 00:00:46.040
for the week and realized

00:00:46.040 --> 00:00:48.040
you're working too much.

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:50.440
Did you go through my calendar?

00:00:50.520 --> 00:00:51.560
Oh my gosh.

00:00:51.560 --> 00:00:53.200
You're like James Bond,

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:55.040
if he were a creepy stalker.

00:00:56.680 --> 00:00:57.480
I did it to free you

00:00:57.480 --> 00:00:58.760
from all obligations.

00:00:59.080 --> 00:00:59.800
Nice.

00:00:59.880 --> 00:01:00.800
Me too?

00:01:03.760 --> 00:01:04.520
Walt,

00:01:04.680 --> 00:01:06.400
quit with your spy things.

00:01:06.640 --> 00:01:08.200
My father needs to be convinced

00:01:08.200 --> 00:01:09.560
this relationship isn't fake.

00:01:09.560 --> 00:01:11.280
So now you're getting

00:01:11.280 --> 00:01:12.880
my full dossier.

00:01:13.720 --> 00:01:15.080
Everything's here.

00:01:15.160 --> 00:01:16.520
My habits.

00:01:16.600 --> 00:01:18.000
Where I like to vacation,

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:19.280
my favorite foods,

00:01:19.280 --> 00:01:20.520
preferred whiskey.

00:01:20.720 --> 00:01:22.200
How boring.

00:01:23.360 --> 00:01:24.560
It also...

00:01:25.320 --> 00:01:26.680
has my sexual

00:01:26.840 --> 00:01:27.880
preferences.
